ai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325290/extras/a4aecd3d551fc182af4ec79c927c3f19.poster.avif?t=1784597874\" width=616 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325290/extras/a4aecd3d551fc182af4ec79c927c3f19.webm?t=1784597874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325290/extras/a4aecd3d551fc182af4ec79c927c3f19.mp4?t=1784597874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <i>Sky </i>is ever-changing and dynamic. Beyond our regular Seasons and events, you can participate in special, limited-time live experiences every year, such as our world-record breaking concert with AURORA, where thousands of players come together in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These events celebrate community, offering interactive elements, fun surprises, and shared moments that make the world feel alive. You’ll never feel alone, experiencing awe, wonder, and emotional depth that redefine what a game can be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325290/extras/a9d510045afaa2f5dcc45688687b74b3.poster.avif?t=1784597874\" width=616 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325290/extras/a9d510045afaa2f5dcc45688687b74b3.webm?t=1784597874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325290/extras/a9d510045afaa2f5dcc45688687b74b3.mp4?t=1784597874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sky </i>has the most wholesome and welcoming community in gaming.  Strangers become friendly guides, playing an instrument can lead to a band, and puzzles blocking your journey are solved with teamwork. Friends can hold your hand and lead you through the realms – no journey or mystery has to be faced alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The community is also incredibly active on our official Discord, social media channels, and on the Steam forums, bringing players together around shared adventures and creativity. <i>Sky</i> and its community go hand-in-hand. We appreciate our community, and we’re confident you'll enjoy becoming a part of it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download <i>Sky</i> and join this incredible community in a beautiful, open-world adventure. See you in the skies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A breathtaking open-world adventure awaits! Explore magical realms, restore lost light, and form wordless bonds with players worldwide. Complete quests and solve puzzles in seasonal events that celebrate kindness, discovery, and heartfelt connection.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Vietnamese, Indonesian, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Portugal, Thai<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325290/ddbf1ae47d8a782280a99c97e2e4cfe882d1adaa/header_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1784597874", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325290/0c77c55f989b13534589d8bb5e35e684ecf0010d/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1784597874", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325290/0c77c55f989b13534589d8bb5e35e684ecf0010d/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1784597874", "website": "https://thatgamecompany.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processo